[
  {
    "description": "Gets the project pages and components XML, with information of the currently focused page or component.

This tool also returns the ID of the currently focused page or component node. When you call insertComponentInCanvas, the component will be inserted into this focused page or component.

The referenced nodeIds can be used with getNodeXml to get the XML of a specific page or component.

Each element in the XML is usually referred as a "node" but the user could also refer to it as a "layer" or "element". The XML structure is similar to Framer's XML layers tree, names are extracted from the layers names given by the user.


",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {},
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "getProjectXml",
  },
  {
    "description": "Gets the currently selected nodes as xml",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {},
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "getSelectedNodesXml",
  },
  {
    "description": "Zooms the canvas to center on the given node ID. Code file nodes are not supported.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "nodeId": {
          "description": "The ID of the node to zoom into view",
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string",
        },
      },
      "required": [
        "nodeId",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "zoomIntoView",
  },
  {
    "description": "Get a specific Framer node as XML. You first need to get a node id via getProjectXml or call getSelectedNodesXml instead",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "nodeId": {
          "description": "The ID of the node to get as XML",
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string",
        },
      },
      "required": [
        "nodeId",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "getNodeXml",
  },
  {
    "description": "Gets all project-level color styles.
XML nodes can use these color styles by setting attributes like backgroundColor to their path, e.g. color="/Primary".
You can also use color styles when setting the color attribute of a text style with updateTextStyle.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {},
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "getProjectColorStyles",
  },
  {
    "description": "Gets all project-level text styles. XML nodes can use these text styles by setting the inlineTextStyle attribute to their path, e.g. inlineTextStyle="/Heading xl".",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {},
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "getProjectTextStyles",
  },
  {
    "description": "Update the XML for a specific node using its nodeId and passing a new XML string. It can be used to update nodes text or attributes.

If a node id changes its parent, it will be moved in the layers tree.

This tool is generally called using a component or page nodeId and passing a portion of the XML tree. To delete nodes you should use deleteNode instead. If a node is omitted it will not be deleted.

You can pass a partial a XML string, there is no need to include the full XML structure, missing nodes will not be updated. You can also omit attributes, omitted attributes will not be updated and will be ignored.

You can use this tool to
- Update text for one or multiple text nodes
- Update attributes of existing nodes

This tool cannot duplicate or delete nodes.
",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "nodeId": {
          "description": "The ID of the node to update",
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string",
        },
        "xml": {
          "description": "XML string containing the updates. Can include multiple nodes with their nodeId attributes",
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string",
        },
      },
      "required": [
        "nodeId",
        "xml",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "updateXmlForNode",
  },
  {
    "description": "Updates a color style by its path. Can modify the name, light color, and dark color.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "stylePath": {
          "description": "The path of the color style to update. Must start with /",
          "type": "string",
        },
        "updates": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "Properties to update on the color style",
          "properties": {
            "dark": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string",
                },
                {
                  "type": "null",
                },
              ],
              "description": "Dark theme color in any CSS color format, or null to remove dark variant",
            },
            "light": {
              "description": "Light theme color in any CSS color format (e.g., "rgb(255, 0, 0)", "#FF0000", "red")",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "name": {
              "description": "The display name of the color style",
              "type": "string",
            },
          },
          "type": "object",
        },
      },
      "required": [
        "stylePath",
        "updates",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "updateColorStyle",
  },
  {
    "description": "Creates a new color style in the project with the specified properties.

The style path must start with "/" and can include folder structure (e.g., "/Brand/Primary").
If a style already exists at the given path, this operation will fail.

After creating, you can reference this style in XML nodes using color="/path/to/style".",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "properties": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "Properties for the new color style. Name and light color are required.",
          "properties": {
            "dark": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string",
                },
                {
                  "type": "null",
                },
              ],
              "description": "Dark theme color in any CSS color format, or null to remove dark variant",
            },
            "light": {
              "description": "Light theme color in any CSS color format (e.g., "rgb(255, 0, 0)", "#FF0000", "red")",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "name": {
              "description": "The display name of the color style",
              "type": "string",
            },
          },
          "required": [
            "name",
            "light",
          ],
          "type": "object",
        },
        "stylePath": {
          "description": "The path for the new color style. Must start with / and be unique",
          "type": "string",
        },
      },
      "required": [
        "stylePath",
        "properties",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "createColorStyle",
  },
  {
    "description": "Updates a text style by its path. Can modify various typography properties.

Updating a text style will update all the nodes that use it in the project.

If you only want to update a single node instead, create a new text style and update the XML to reference its new path instead.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "stylePath": {
          "description": "The path of the text style to update. Must start with /",
          "type": "string",
        },
        "updates": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "Properties to update on the text style",
          "properties": {
            "alignment": {
              "description": "Text alignment",
              "enum": [
                "left",
                "center",
                "right",
                "justify",
              ],
              "type": "string",
            },
            "balance": {
              "description": "Enable balanced text wrapping for better legibility",
              "type": "boolean",
            },
            "boldFont": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string",
                },
                {
                  "type": "null",
                },
              ],
              "description": "Bold variant font selector or null to remove",
            },
            "boldItalicFont": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string",
                },
                {
                  "type": "null",
                },
              ],
              "description": "Bold italic variant font selector or null to remove",
            },
            "color": {
              "description": "Color as hex, rgba, or color style path (e.g., "#FF0000", "rgb(255, 0, 0)", "/Primary")",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "decoration": {
              "description": "Text decoration",
              "enum": [
                "none",
                "underline",
                "line-through",
              ],
              "type": "string",
            },
            "decorationColor": {
              "description": "Decoration color as hex, rgba, or color style path",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "decorationOffset": {
              "description": "Decoration offset (e.g., "auto", "2px", "0.1em")",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "decorationSkipInk": {
              "description": "Text decoration skip ink behavior",
              "enum": [
                "auto",
                "none",
                "all",
              ],
              "type": "string",
            },
            "decorationStyle": {
              "description": "Text decoration style",
              "enum": [
                "solid",
                "double",
                "dotted",
                "dashed",
                "wavy",
              ],
              "type": "string",
            },
            "decorationThickness": {
              "description": "Decoration thickness (e.g., "auto", "2px", "0.1em")",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "font": {
              "description": "Font selector (e.g., "GF;Inter-600")",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "fontSize": {
              "description": "Font size with units (e.g., "16px", "1.5rem")",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "italicFont": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string",
                },
                {
                  "type": "null",
                },
              ],
              "description": "Italic variant font selector or null to remove",
            },
            "letterSpacing": {
              "description": "Letter spacing with units (e.g., "0px", "0.05em")",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "lineHeight": {
              "description": "Line height with units (e.g., "24px", "1.5em", "150%")",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "name": {
              "description": "The display name of the text style",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "paragraphSpacing": {
              "description": "Space between paragraphs in pixels",
              "type": "number",
            },
            "tag": {
              "description": "HTML tag associated with the text style",
              "enum": [
                "h1",
                "h2",
                "h3",
                "h4",
                "h5",
                "h6",
                "p",
              ],
              "type": "string",
            },
            "transform": {
              "description": "Text transformation",
              "enum": [
                "none",
                "uppercase",
                "lowercase",
                "capitalize",
              ],
              "type": "string",
            },
          },
          "type": "object",
        },
      },
      "required": [
        "stylePath",
        "updates",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "updateTextStyle",
  },
  {
    "description": "Creates a new text style in the project with the specified properties.

The style path must start with "/" and can include folder structure (e.g., "/Typography/Headings/H1").
If a style already exists at the given path, this operation will fail.

After creating, you can reference this style in XML nodes using inlineTextStyle="/path/to/style".",
